<form action="/transferFunds" method="POST">
    <input type="hidden" name="csrfToken" value="{{ csrfToken }}">
    <!-- Form fields -->
</form>
```

In this example, a CSRF token is generated for each user session and included in the form. The token is validated on the server-side before processing the request. This approach helps prevent CSRF attacks by ensuring that requests originate from the expected source.

